Description: Drive vinyl cutters, plotters and engravers from SVG/DXF/bitmap input
 Inkcut C++ is a Qt6 reimplementation of the Inkcut workflow:
 load an SVG, DXF or bitmap (via potrace), apply geometry filters
 (blade offset, min-line, repeats, weedlines), order the cuts and
 send HPGL / DMPL / GPGL / G-code / CAMM commands over a serial
 port or save them to a file.
 .
 Includes both a GUI application (inkcut-gui) and a command-line
 batch converter (inkcut-cpp).
